<Base title="Changelog">
  <h1>Changelog</h1>
  <p>This site is versioned like software and logged like a lab notebook.</p>
  <dl>
    <dt><strong>v2.0.0</strong>, October 20, 2026</dt>
    <dd>Launched. First essay: <a href="/writing/the-prototype-was-too-small">The prototype was too small</a>.</dd>
    <dt><strong>v2.0.0-draft.2</strong>, October 20, 2026</dt>
    <dd>Two real recordings from my watch in the Pulse lab: a morning run and a day hike into the Grand Canyon. New Training page from twelve weeks of Fitbod logs. Restoration page with a before-and-after slider. Share cards for every page. Automated checks on every push: accessibility, page speed, and a test that the camera never turns on by itself.</dd>
    <dt><strong>v2.0.0-draft</strong>, October 20, 2026</dt>
    <dd>Tore down the old Next.js site and rebuilt it in Astro. New look: a chart recorder on an engineering pad. First exhibit: a night of my own heart rate, and a signal-processing explorable built on it.</dd>
    <dt><strong>v1</strong>, 2024</dt>
    <dd>Next.js portfolio, retired.</dd>
  </dl>
</Base>
